ced in:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108075\n\n### System information\n\nN/A\n\n### Issue description\n\nLoading any project that has not generated the UID cache, with a scene referenced by UID (the default), will fail to open and there's no way to recover without removing the main scene manually from the project file, running with `--import` or `--headless` has no effect (at least on Windows)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a project, add a scene and make it the main scene, remove the `.godot` file (or load a project from some other source, like checking out a project in VCS)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[editor-main-scene.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22490865/editor-main-scene.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110807/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110807/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reaso